menu "Unified BSP Demo Configuration"

    config DEMO_DEBUG_BYPASS_PROV
        bool "Bypass Provisioning & Force Live Telemetry Dashboard (Debug Mode)"
        default n
        help
            When enabled (or when the BOOT button is held down at power-up),
            the firmware skips BLE provisioning and claiming token flows,
            and boots directly into the active telemetry dashboard with live sensor polling.

    config DEMO_DEBUG_DISABLE_DEEP_SLEEP
        bool "Disable Deep Sleep in Debug Mode (Continuous Bench Testing)"
        default y
        help
            Keeps the ESP32-S3 awake continuously during debug/testing mode so you can
            test touch interaction and live sensor polling without entering deep sleep.

endmenu
